{"seq":13,"trial_id":"anatomy-instruction-route-2026-11/openclaw-haiku-gbrain-route-skill-mu-v03-dev/sy-02-marrow-agrisupply-sites/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-30T22:11:47.150Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"171b9127e2f0a8346b11a764723034b81a93eee3d281785e341563b051ce3b5d","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DANATOM0001","text":"Pree, I went through #central-team, the only channel you're in that could hold this. I found two Marrow Agrisupply sites, both in the June 9 thread, and nothing else in the channel names a Marrow site.\n\n1. **Eastbank**: Hollis mentioned it with ticket PD-4821 (receiving-door import). The file labels doors E1/E2, but the booking sheet uses 01/02, so the import needs fixing before anyone reimports. Source: #central-team, Hollis, June 9, 10:46.\n2. **Pine Crossing**: You raised it. The appointment screen shows only the afternoon shift, so a driver who arrived at 7:10 had his trailer number written on a sticky note. Source: #central-team, you, June 9, 10:48.\n\nTwo things I couldn't resolve:\n- Hollis's and your messages say the rollout tracker has three rows that just say \"waiting,\" and you were going to get names and blockers from store ops. Those rows aren't in the channel, so the other stores aren't listed.\n- The 2025 messages mention a \"Wichita store dispatcher\" and the Marrow office-hours Zoom link. Neither is labelled as a Marrow site, so I left them out.\n\nI also couldn't find a Marrow account folder in the shared files (the CRM path for the account isn't there), so this list comes only from the channel."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DANATOM0001","ts":"1791987000.000124"}}
